    "market_commentary": "At 5,589, the SSY Pacific Capesize index fell 2,007 points from last week. SSY's assessed AustraliaChina spot voyage rate decreased $2.15/t to $8.55/t, recording a seven-week low. Meanwhile, the Pacific round-voyage rate fell $10,100/day to $13,750/day.",
